"h.ff0uwzw5b3yf","title":"Evil Alliance","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-202524","runs":[{"text":"→ Evil Alliance, defend Dage's Underworld from Malgor ("},{"text":"/join darkally","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dark-ally"},{"text":")."},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-202596","runs":[{"text":"→ Dage vs Nulgath, help Dage defeat the dark alliance that is Nulgath and Malgor ("},{"text":"/join darkalliance","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dark-alliance"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-202700","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wejLE1CIeZ0"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ocJ3z-IJhzM"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.sx8komug2vgy","title":"Beast of the Legion","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-202761","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" The Beast, an undead creature of mass destruction, is now attempting to wreak havoc on Lore due to the breaking of its previous seals ("},{"text":"/join sevencircles","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/seven-circles"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-202927","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II:","bold":true},{"text":" Dage has bolstered the Seven Circles' guards with his Undead Legion, emphasizing the importance of preventing the Beast's liberation as heroes of Lore ("},{"text":"/join sevencircleswar","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/seven-circles-war"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-203115","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6oLSsrEUiys"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-YOY8-VUc2k"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.qh924jtr2xlh","title":"Master of the Underworld","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-203181","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" Set in the past, you'll battle as Nulgath's Commandant. Your task, to observe Dage the Lich, a promising new addition to your Master's Nation... and assess his loyalty ("},{"text":"/join fiendpast","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/fiend-past"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-203378","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II:","bold":true},{"text":" Play as Dage as you recruit powerful allies, take out potential enemies, and gear up for war against his former master, Nulgath ("},{"text":"/join dagerecruit","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dage-recruit"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-203538","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"War:","bold":true},{"text":" Prove your loyalty and worth as you fight to determine -- again -- which Commander's forces are strongest, and whose power is darkest ("},{"text":"/join darkwar","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dark-war-hub"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-203697","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BxV_2-8JPB0"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wpUbTNVFobk"},{"text":" - Part 3: "},{"text":"Dark War Legion","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KW524jSt5Tk"},{"text":", "},{"text":"Dark War Nation","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iDTNE4Z5kw0"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.v0eyh59olyeb","title":"The Curse & The Blessing","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-203806","runs":[{"text":"Yêu cầu hoàn thành ","italic":true},{"text":"Temple of Light Invation","italic":true},{"text":" để mở khoá Storyline này.\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-203876","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" Battle as the young Empress Gravelyn as she fights to defend her father's fortress from Undead Legion invaders while he recovers from injury ("},{"text":"/join siegefortress","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/siege-fortress"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-204050","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II:","bold":true},{"text":" "},{"text":"The battle between the Shadowscythe and the Legion was interrupted by the machinations of an unknown Light Elemental"},{"text":" ("},{"text":"/join fortressdelve","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/fortress-delve"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-204202","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tvgQNDeELNE"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U585_schYgQ"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.in17regp22yb","title":"Kingdom of Atlas","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-204262","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" Sinister shadows lurk inside the brightly shining walls of Atlas, and they are the reason that YOU h"},{"text":"ave a mission for Dage and his Legion: Demolish the city ("},{"text":"/join atlaspromenade","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/atlas-promenade"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-204453","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II:","bold":true},{"text":" Your mission is clear. Voices from beyond are asking for justice. They paid the price. Now YOU must reveal the truth to all"},{"text":" ("},{"text":"/join atlaskingdom","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/atlas-kingdom"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-204610","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part III:","bold":true},{"text":" Zedek's victory over Dage scarred the Legion but what is undead can NEVER die. They are without their Lord but march in your name. The price has been paid ("},{"text":"/join atlasfalls","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/atlas-falls"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-204798","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1swVSlvogTQ"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJPOButoXeE"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1hB9JqxUhM"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.a6em6ke31pbg","title":"Seasonal Dark Birthday Events","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-204880","runs":[{"text":"Các Story Seasonal thuộc event Dark Birthday diễn ra vào tháng 3\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-204945","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"2014:","bold":true},{"text":" Dage has summoned four legendary horsemen from the apocalypse to test your strength, valor, determination, and skill ("},{"text":"/join undervoid","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/undervoid"},{"text":")."},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-205089","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"2017:","bold":true},{"text":" The battle to control the future rages on as Dage the Evil fights his most dangerous enemy! ("},{"text":"/join futurelegion","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/future-legion"},{"text":" và "},{"text":"/join futurewar","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/future-war"},{"text":")\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-205229","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"2018:","bold":true},{"text":" Dage the Evil, leader of the Undead Legion, is poised to break free of the hold Nulgath the ArchFiend has on his soul ("},{"text":"/join darkpath","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dark-path"},{"text":" và "},{"text":"/join voidvault","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/void-vault"},{"text":")\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-205391","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"2020:","bold":true},{"text":" The Legion requires many souls to make up its army, and his newest General has arrived to feast upon those brave enough to challenge him ("},{"text":"/join abysslair","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/abyssal-lair"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-205555","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"2024:","bold":true},{"text":" The Legion must have capable, trustworthy Generals if Dage the Evil is going to forge a dark new future. But the undead are restless, and he needs your help to discover what drives their discontent ("},{"text":"/join legionbarracks","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/legion-barracks"},{"text":" và "},{"text":"/join cocytusbarracks","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/cocytus-barracks"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-205810","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"2026:","bold":true},{"text":" The Undead Legion assembles for the Reap of the Millennia, a brand-new, merciless competition where only the strongest and most intelligent can live, under the menacing light of Blood Moon ("},{"text":"/join legiontournament","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/legion-tournament"},{"text":", "},{"text":"/join phlegethonarena","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/phlegethon-arena"},{"text":" và "},{"text":"/join reapfinals","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/reap-finals"},{"text":")"},{"text":".\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-206077","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":":\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-206101","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Undervoid","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3a1PBdcGsqI"},{"text":" "},{"text":"(2014)","italic":true},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-206120","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Future Legion","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VNCtkpFqA-E"},{"text":" & "},{"text":"Future War","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B2KZF-h3R_I"},{"text":" "},{"text":"(2017)","italic":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-206156","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Dark Path","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_L7meEx8O3E"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Void Vault","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NyZt65D46so"},{"text":" "},{"text":"(2018)","italic":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-206188","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Abyssal Lair","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NZZag3vya7I"},{"text":" "},{"text":"(2020)","italic":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-206210","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Legion Barracks","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=js-SuyYsozM"},{"text":" & "},{"text":"Cocytus Barracks","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VOuqrzNP8"},{"text":" "},{"text":"(2024)\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-206254","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Legion Tournament","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tJ8H_1fsQJ8"},{"text":" & "},{"text":"Phlegethon Arena","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTt0YjouH8k"},{"text":" & "},{"text":"Reap Finals","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=arsZtbl1qA4"},{"text":" "},{"text":"(2026)","italic":true},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]}]}],"previous":{"title":"Nulgath's Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/nulgath-s-saga"},"next":{"title":"The Throne of Darkness Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/the-throne-of-darkness-saga"},"missingImageCount":5}